      "prompt": "Contract: {{question}}\nGame state: {{game}}\nCurrent book: {{quote}}\nPrice velocity (10min): {{velocity}}\nMinutes since last goal: {{last_goal}}\nRecent shocks: {{shock}}\nRecent bars: {{path}}\n\nAnalyze: Is the current score/game state already fully priced into the book? Look at:\n1. Did the mid jump sharply when the last goal/card happened, or is it still catching up?\n2. Has the book been stable for several minutes after the event?\n3. Is there persistent one-sided flow suggesting repricing is ongoing?\n\nRespond with JSON.",
      "tools": [],
      "max_tool_iterations": 0,
      "output_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "already_priced": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "True if recent events are fully absorbed"
          },
          "repricing_direction": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "If still repricing: 'up', 'down', or 'none'"
          },
          "repricing_cents": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "Estimated cents left to reprice, 0 if already_priced"
          },
          "reasoning": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": ["already_priced", "repricing_direction", "repricing_cents", "reasoning"]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "prompt",
      "name": "predict",
      "output_key": "prediction",
      "prompt": "Contract: {{question}}\nGame: {{game}}\nBook: {{quote}}\nRecent trades: {{tape}}\nPricing analysis: {{pricing_state}}\n\nForecast the mid's move over the next 5 minutes.\n\nKey drivers:\n1. REPRICING: If pricing_state shows unfinished repricing, that dominates. Use the repricing_cents estimate.\n2. CLOCK DECAY: With >20min left and a lead, decay is real but slow (1-3c per 5min for 1-goal leads at mid-game). Early game (0-10') has negligible decay.\n3. GOALS: At 0-0 or close scores, goals are the main risk. Early in games, quote WIDE (6-10c half-width) because you have no edge on when goals happen.\n4. THIN BOOKS: Wide spreads (>2c) mean low liquidity. Quote wider.\n\nRules:\n- If 0-0 and <15' into the match: half_width >= 7 cents (high goal risk, no edge)\n- If repricing ongoing: use that signal, but keep half_width >= 4c\n- If stable book, no recent events, mid-game: half_width 3-5c, delta near zero\n- Never predict >5c move unless there's clear repricing evidence\n\nReturn JSON with your 5-minute forecast.",
      "tools": [],
      "max_tool_iterations": 0,
      "output_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "delta_cents": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "Cents the mid will MOVE over 5 minutes. Negative for down, 0 for stable."
          },
          "half_width_cents": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "Half-width in cents. Wide (7+) early in 0-0 games, 3-5 when stable, 4-6 when repricing."
          },
          "confidence": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "0-1"
          },
          "driver": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Primary reason for the move or stability"
          },
          "falsifier": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "What would prove this wrong before settlement"
          }
        },
        "required": ["delta_cents", "half_width_cents", "confidence", "driver", "falsifier"]
      }
    }
  ]
